# tests/secret-scan.expected — every secret-scan finding this repository is
# known to carry, one per line, as
#
#   <rule-id>	<repo-relative path>	<fingerprint>
#
# tests/secret-scan.sh gate-tree compares the scan's findings to this file as
# a MULTISET, both directions; gate-history compares DISTINCT identities, since
# every edit of a declared line re-adds it to history. An undeclared finding
# fails the gate. A declaration nothing produced also fails it — that is the shrink path:
# fixing a false positive means deleting its line in the same commit.
#
# The fingerprint hashes the rule, the path, gitleaks' redacted match text and
# its entropy. It is deliberately NOT derived from a line number, so editing an
# unrelated line in one of these files does not invalidate the declaration,
# while a different secret appearing in a file that already carries a declared
# false positive produces an identity nothing here matches. Regenerate a
# changed one by reading it out of the gate's own DECLARED-BUT-ABSENT /
# UNEXPECTED output; never transcribe a matched value here.
#
# All four below are generic-api-key on non-secrets, and none is a credential:
#
#   .env.example                                    the WG_INIT_PASSWORD line, empty-valued
#   tests/unit/wizard-flow/rerun-resume.sh          the same empty-valued line, in a fixture
#   tests/unit/wizard-flow/demo-and-full-install.sh the same empty-valued line, in a fixture
#   docs/setup/configuration-schema.md              prose about which DDNS credentials are
#                                                    never written to .env
#
# The wizard-flow.sh scenario split (for the line cap) moved the two
# byte-identical fixture lines into two different scenario files; the
# fingerprint is path-derived, so each now has its own distinct declaration
# instead of the one path carrying the finding twice.
generic-api-key	.env.example	e0275f267c4435bb
generic-api-key	docs/setup/configuration-schema.md	a256dd87d6b9ff9e
generic-api-key	tests/unit/wizard-flow/rerun-resume.sh	47779da718d8f875
generic-api-key	tests/unit/wizard-flow/demo-and-full-install.sh	ec45ccbd239d79b5
